Corpus & Examination Material Rights Notice (See NOTICE.md)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
This MIT license applies strictly to the independent software implementation
(HTML, Canvas/SVG graph renderer, query/learning models, and Python tooling).

Past-paper examination questions and source metadata in `data/` are extracted
from historical JM (Master of Laws) examination papers for personal study and
structural research. Copyright and related rights in original examination
materials remain with their respective rights holders; publishing this
repository's code and candidate index does not transfer or alter any rights in
the underlying examination papers. Original PDF papers are not distributed in
this repository. For complete provenance and academic boundaries, see NOTICE.md.
